+## Test summary
+
+`uv run pytest` — 1942 passed, 2 xfailed (1937 baseline + 5 new tests: two of the brief's own, plus
+`_condition_report_by_levels`, `_compute_declared_contrasts`, and the `_compute_vs_baseline`
